    "statement": "theorem literal_jv_exact_algebra_certificate : Module.finrank F A=8 ∧ Module.length F A=8 ∧ (X 2^3 : Poly)∉JVMacaulayAudit.sourceIdeal ∧ (∀ d : ℕ, (∀ i j k : ℕ, d ≤ i+j+k → (X 0^i*X 1^j*X 2^k : Poly)∈JVMacaulayAudit.sourceIdeal) ↔ 4 ≤ d) ∧ ∀ (L : Type) [Field L] [CharP L 101] (u v w : L), (JVMacaulayAudit.f0 u v w=0 ∧ JVMacaulayAudit.f1 u v w=0 ∧ JVMacaulayAudit.f2 u v w=0) ↔ u=0 ∧ v=0 ∧ w=0",
