    "scope": "Literal first Joux-Vitse F101^3 toy homogeneous coordinate ideal, over F101: actual eight-element quotient basis, coordinate algebra finrank8 and scalar-field module length8; h^3 outside the actual ideal, and all monomials with total degree>=d belong to the actual ideal iff4<=d. Over every characteristic101 field the three source equations hold iff all coordinates are zero, so geometric support is the origin. Cubic linear functional annihilates every polynomial multiple of each actual source generator;64dual identities give independence and24coordinate multiplication relations plus polynomial induction prove spanning. No assumed Groebner basis/native Hilbert output/generic regularity/internal F4 execution or solving degree. Scalar-field length only; canonical graded Hilbert-function identification, generic JV, curve order and source scalar relations remain separate.",
